<h2 id="cli" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. CLI</h2>

```bash
python ops/local/run_all.py pgbattest --scope places:cities
python ops/local/run_all.py pgbattest --scopes places:cities,numbers:ordinals
python ops/local/run_all.py pgbattest --scopes animated:animals,animated:two-forms --door-c-mode PER_SHIPPED_SCOPE
python ops/local/run_all.py pgbattest --scope places:cities --no-door-c
```

Default: isolated `:8003`. Door C Pair A/B: `config/main_config.yaml` → `non_conj_paragraph.door_c.judge_a` / `judge_b`. See also `pglpl-live --max-items 5` / `--all-pool` for manual single doors. Module: `-m pglpl_live.word_loop.stage_gate`.
